[tool_result] toolu_01JoGHHHvvduSB36XezLPpsu 117	
118	### Phase 2b.4: Wire `inputSource = 'phone'` into engine + sessions
119	Add `'phone'` to the `InputSource` union; expose phone selection in
120	Settings; gate Idle/Start on a paired-phone pre-flight; subscribe the
121	TrainerScreen to the DataChannel and route `commit` messages through
122	the same `recordPress(at)` path as keyboard/pedal.
123	
124	Acceptance criteria:
125	- Settings input-source select offers "Phone (motion)" alongside
126	  keyboard / pedal.
127	- If `inputSource === 'phone'` and no DataChannel is connected, Idle
128	  shows a "Phone not paired — pair now" banner and disables Start.
129	- With a paired phone, Start runs the drill and commits drive reps.
130	- Saved `SessionRecord.inputSource === 'phone'`.
131	- Existing 105+ tests still pass. New tests cover the union widening,
132	  the IdleScreen pre-flight gate, and the TrainerScreen subscription
133	  path.
134	- Manual real-device QA at `app/verify-phase-2b4.mjs` covers the full
135	  pair → calibrate →
