[text] Designed: Zustand `phone-peer` slice exposes mirrored `status` + `lastCommit` for reactive UI; module-level `activeHandle` holds the actual `PeerHandle` (to avoid object-identity re-render storms) with `getActivePhonePeer()` accessor for procedural callers; `onCommit(handler)` for TrainerScreen subscription. PairScreen will reuse an existing peer if connected, and cleanup will only stop the camera — peer outlives PairScreen so the user can pair → close → start drill.

Writing TDD tests for the slice first.
